# Runtime bookkeeping: pids, handoff tokens, a persistent lock inode. Specific to the
# machine that ran it, rewritten on every wake, and not evidence of anything.
docs/agent-log/run-gates/listing-expansion-automation/
docs/agent-log/*.transaction.lock
docs/agent-log/run-gates/*.transaction.lock
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.bak-*
